sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as FinanceEntryPage (SPA)
  participant Routes as REST Route Layer
  participant Session as Session and Role Resolver
  participant Policy as SoD Policy
  participant EntrySvc as Journal Entry Service
  participant ApprovalSvc as Approval Service
  participant EntryRepo as Entry Repository
  participant HistRepo as History Repository

  Note over UI: Auditor opens a posted entry's page
  UI->>Routes: GET /api/finance/entries/:id
  Routes->>Session: resolveCallerRoles(request)
  Session-->>Routes: roles=[auditor]
  Routes->>Policy: authorize(action=read, roles=[auditor])
  Policy-->>Routes: allowed
  Routes->>EntrySvc: getEntry(id)
  EntrySvc->>EntryRepo: findById(id)
  EntryRepo-->>EntrySvc: entry
  Routes->>ApprovalSvc: getHistory(id)
  ApprovalSvc->>HistRepo: listByEntry(id)
  HistRepo-->>ApprovalSvc: history rows
  ApprovalSvc-->>Routes: history
  EntrySvc-->>Routes: entry
  Routes-->>UI: 200 {entry, history}
  UI-->>UI: render read-only entry and full approval history, hide/disable write actions

  Note over UI: Auditor calls approve on a submitted entry
  UI->>Routes: POST /api/finance/entries/:id/approve
  Routes->>Session: resolveCallerRoles(request)
  Session-->>Routes: roles=[auditor]
  Routes->>Policy: authorize(action=approve, roles=[auditor])
  Policy-->>Routes: denied
  Routes-->>UI: 403 {error: role not permitted}
  Note over EntryRepo,HistRepo: no status change, no history row appended

  Note over UI: Auditor calls reject on the same submitted entry
  UI->>Routes: POST /api/finance/entries/:id/reject
  Routes->>Session: resolveCallerRoles(request)
  Session-->>Routes: roles=[auditor]
  Routes->>Policy: authorize(action=reject, roles=[auditor])
  Policy-->>Routes: denied
  Routes-->>UI: 403 {error: role not permitted}

  Note over UI: Auditor calls create-entry
  UI->>Routes: POST /api/finance/entries
  Routes->>Session: resolveCallerRoles(request)
  Session-->>Routes: roles=[auditor]
  Routes->>Policy: authorize(action=create, roles=[auditor])
  Policy-->>Routes: denied
  Routes-->>UI: 403 {error: role not permitted}
  Note over EntryRepo: no entry row inserted

  Note over UI: Auditor calls submit-entry
  UI->>Routes: POST /api/finance/entries/:id/submit
  Routes->>Session: resolveCallerRoles(request)
  Session-->>Routes: roles=[auditor]
  Routes->>Policy: authorize(action=submit, roles=[auditor])
  Policy-->>Routes: denied
  Routes-->>UI: 403 {error: role not permitted}
  Note over HistRepo: no submit row appended
